ralize the repeated task-number validation and one-based to zero-based\nindex conversion used by mark, unmark, and delete commands.\n\nThe shared parseValidTaskIndex helper keeps the validation rules consistent\nwhile preserving each command\u0027s specific error message and task operation.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":25,"deletions":21}}},{"hash":"7492deb699002049dbea522e6e8ec3b0f6f257cc","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Clarify stored task format","messageBody":"Replace opaque task-type codes, completion-status codes, and field positions\nin Storage with named constants.\n\nThe serialized file format remains unchanged, but the parser and writer are\neasier to understand and maintain because literal values no longer hide\ntheir meaning.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":36,"deletions":26}}},{"hash":"2d82b0868930d82ba0f788cf7b9dabf2852916f4","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Encapsulate task state","messageBody":"Restrict Task fields to private visibility because subclasses do not access\nthem directly. Make descriptions final because they do not change after\nconstruction.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":2,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"6863b9539732c42b785fa17410071b3cad2fdb6a","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Protect task-list ownership","messageBody":"Copy supplied tasks and return an unmodifiable snapshot so external code\ncannot modify TaskList\u0027s internal collection directly.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":25,"deletions":5}}},{"hash":"730ccce16cd8b269a92e7e3c24dd38dd013363b3","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Unify numbered task display","messageBody":"Extract the shared one-based task-numbering loop used by list and find\nresponses. This prevents duplicated formatting logic from drifting while\npreserving each response\u0027s distinct heading.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":34,"deletions":6}}},{"hash":"3eae2d4dca299d5a78abc349